{"id": "EUVD-2026-102530", "enisaUuid": "fbbd7689-4457-3ff1-9938-d75fbe5277cf", "description": "nifti_clib through 3.0.1 contains a stack-based out-of-bounds read and write vulnerability in nifti_convert_n2hdr2nim() because the NIfTI-2 dim[0] value is never range-checked. Attackers can supply a crafted 540-byte NIfTI-2 header read via nifti_image_read() to crash applications or corrupt stack memory.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T01:37:40", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/nifticlib-nifti2-dim0-oob", "https://github.com/NIFTI-Imaging/nifti_clib/issues/195", "https://github.com/NIFTI-Imaging/nifti_clib/pull/197", "https://github.com/NIFTI-Imaging/nifti_clib/blob/96b9954fafcf3bd69a4ee2091b0d707ed2077697/nifti2/nifti2_io.c#L4985-L5026", "https://github.com/NIFTI-Imaging/nifti_clib", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/nifti-clib-through-3.0.1-stack-out-of-bounds-access-via-nifti-convert-n2hdr2nim"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111275", "GHSA-jj37-jg79-p9qw"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c50f11e4-a570-38f5-b2f6-7c7d8223dfeb", "product": {"name": "nifti_clib", "vendor": {"name": "NIFTI-Imaging"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.0.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1fc0f49c-0f09-3ce8-8d28-819242e15740", "vendor": {"name": "NIFTI-Imaging"}}], "isExploited": false}